{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "代码改动(2026-09-24):大数 = 今天 Claude Code 新增的行数(编辑补丁里行首 + 的行 + 新建文件的行);柱 = 近 7 天每天新增 + 删除;底行 = 近 7 天合计与对比前 7 天。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "代码改动",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "sub": "今天新增 · 删除 ",
        "d7": "近 7 天 "
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Lines",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "sub": "Added today · removed ",
        "d7": "7 days "
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "代码改动(2026-09-24):大数 = 今天 Claude Code 新增的行数(编辑补丁里行首 + 的行 + 新建文件的行);柱 = 近 7 天每天新增 + 删除;底行 = 近 7 天合计与对比前 7 天。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.lines.add}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "big",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "+${w.lines.add}",
            "fontSize": "28pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.lines.add}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+8.4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "28pt",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}*0.26+32pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.sub}$[findNotEmpty::(${w.lines.del},--)]",
        "fontSize": "10pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1"
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "{parent.h}-32pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "1pt",
        "bgColor": "#EFE5E1|#2A2522"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "forEach",
        "props": {
          "items": "${w.lines.bars}",
          "key": "_it",
          "index": "_i"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "12pt+${_it.i}*({parent.w}-24pt)/7",
            "y": "{parent.h}-58pt+26pt*${_it.u}",
            "w": "({parent.w}-24pt)/7-5pt",
            "h": "26pt*${_it.v}",
            "cornerRadius": {
              "leftT": "1.5pt",
              "rightT": "1.5pt",
              "leftB": "0pt",
              "rightB": "0pt"
            },
            "bgColor": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.t},1),#C15F3C|#E8916B,#E9D5CD|#3B302B)]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.lines.sum7}),k),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.d7}${w.lines.sum7}  ${w.lines.c}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.lines.sum7}),k),0,1),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12pt",
            "y": "{parent.h}-24pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.d7}--",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "时效锚:右上角、与卡名同一基线、9pt、右对齐(卡片设计系统 §3)。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12pt",
        "y": "14pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},${@i18n.empty})]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      }
    ]
  }
}